UID:5d5bf43e9e8qleceej8omgniaf@google.com
CREATED:20200124T203207Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><p>Hey folks\,</p><p>Following CDC recommendations to help 
 slow the spread of COVID-19\, we've made the difficult decision to put all 
 Hub education programming on hold. Our apologies for the late notice - we a
 re responding as new information is made available. We'll let you know as s
 oon as regular programming resumes.</p>Come on in anytime between 1 and 3pm
  to make some gnocchi. Gnocchi are pillowy Italian potato dumplings made of
  flour\, potatoes and egg but vary in flavor and technique depending on the
  region. They are boiled and then served with a sauce such as tomato or bro
 wn butter sage. Come ready to get messy with flour and eat some lunch!<br><
 br><br>*This drop-in workshop does not require registration.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200311T194959Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gnocchi Drop-In
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
