CREATED:20220725T160600Z
DESCRIPTION:Are you wondering who is eating your collards\, why your squash
  plants are wilting\, or what’s causing fruitless tomatoes? Pests\, disease
  and nutrient imbalances start to plague many home gardens at this time of 
 year\, and can be tricky to understand and fix.&nbsp\; This workshop will h
 elp you to troubleshoot these types of&nbsp\; issues\, and guide you toward
  the healthy solutions for your whole garden! To register\, email Audrey at
  <a href="mailto:garden@mhcfoodpantry.org"><u>garden@mhcfoodpantry.org</u><
 /a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220725T160600Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Garden Problem Solving Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
