  in flavor\, packed full of nutrients and grow both quickly and easily. We 
 will run through the how’s of growing\, do some tasting and then prepare so
 me delicious dishes.\n\nCall 812-355-6843 or e-mail Alissa at education@mhc
 foodpantry.org to register. Workshops are open to all! Those who don’t meet
  the guidelines for our food pantry can attend the workshop\, with a sugges
 ted donation of $5 per person.
