DESCRIPTION:Embark on a colorful adventure of eco dyeing with bandanas in o
 ur immersive workshop! Indulge yourself in the fascinating world of natural
  dyes and discover the magic of transforming plain fabric into vibrant work
 s of wearable art\, all while promoting sustainable practices. Join us for 
 an unforgettable eco dyeing workshop and unleash your creativity while maki
 ng a positive impact on the planet. Experience the joy of sustainable craft
 smanship\, celebrate the beauty of natural dyes\, and leave with a renewed 
 appreciation for the artistry that lies within our natural world. Email gar
 den@mhcfoodpantry.org to register.
