CREATED:20190905T205852Z
DESCRIPTION:It's here! Mother Hubbard's Cupboard is hosting our 9th annual 
 Garden Gala on September 14th. Join us from 6:30 to 9:00 for an evening of 
 local food\, hand-crafted cocktails from Cardinal Spirits\, live music\, an
 d dancing! We'll have local food from Board + Blade\, Rainbow Bakery\, Hops
 cotch Coffee\, and more. DJ Rebecca Fasman will be setting the mood and Car
 dinal Spirits will be serving up a signature cocktail made with herbs for t
 he Hub's very own garden. We will be raffling off donations from local busi
 nesses\, including generous gift cards from Cardinal Spirits\, tickets to t
 he Comedy Attic\, and chance to spend an hour with Bloomington’s own celebr
 ity cat\, Lil’Bub. Tickets are available now at https://www.mhcfoodpantry.o
 rg/special-events!\n\nProceeds from the Garden Gala will support the Hub’s 
 garden and nutrition programs\, which work to teach community members about
  growing their own food and cooking nutritious\, cost-effective meals\, hel
 ping to fulfill our goal of increasing access to healthy food in ways that 
 cultivate dignity\, self-sufficiency\, and community.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190905T205852Z
LOCATION:1100 W. Allen Street
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Garden Gala
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
