CREATED:20190115T210203Z
DESCRIPTION:Come on in for our plant based workshop this month! Creatively 
 incorporating more vegetables into your regular kitchen routine can be a ch
 allenge sometimes but we will be sharing vegetable recipes to make it easie
 r. We’ll also share tips on how to use tofu\, introduce you to the magic of
  nutritional yeast and how to substitute a variety of ingredients for eggs.
 \n\nCall 812-355-6843 or e-mail Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org to re
 gister. Workshops are open to all! Those who don’t meet the guidelines for 
 our food pantry can attend the workshop\, with a suggested donation of $5 p
 er person.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190115T210309Z
LOCATION:Mother Hubbard's Cupboard\, Bloomington\, IN 47403\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:On Vegetables and Cooking
TRANSP:OPAQUE
