CREATED:20190429T194332Z
DESCRIPTION:Making your own noodles is a great skill to have. If you keep f
 lour and water around\, then you will always be able to have pasta! Homemad
 e noodles are so tender and flavorful\, it seems unfair to even try to comp
 are to dried\, store bought pasta. Since they only take minutes to cook\, a
 ll the prep goes into the making of the noodles. It certainly takes some ti
 me\, but it’s interesting and enjoyable work.\n\nTo register for this works
 hop\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org.
