DESCRIPTION:<a href="goog_366514198">Join us for the monthly Hub Dinner! Si
 t down over a hearty meal\, connect with other community members\, and talk
  shop about everything from food systems to healthcare\, housing to transpo
 rtation!&nbsp\;</a><br><a href="goog_366514198"><br></a><br><a href="goog_3
 66514198">At this month's Dinner\, we'll be learning about how the Indiana 
 legislature works - from its timeline to how a bill becomes law\, and every
 thing in between! Join us as we learn all this and more through an interact
 ive\, dungeons &amp\; dragons-esque game.&nbsp\;</a><br><a href="goog_36651
 4198"><br></a><br><a href="goog_366514198">This Dinner is a part of our Fal
 l series on how the Indiana Legislature works. Month-by-month we'll learn e
 verything from when &amp\; how the state's legislative session happens\, to
  how a bill gets passed at the State level\, from how to connect with legis
 lators\, to how to tell a compelling personal story.&nbsp\;</a><br><a href=
 "goog_366514198"><br></a><br><a href="goog_366514198">No advocacy experienc
 e necessary to join\, new faces always welcome! Dinner will be vegetarian-f
 riendly!&nbsp\;</a><br><a href="goog_366514198"><br></a><br><a href="https:
 //www.facebook.com/events/493520184774476/" id="ow513" __is_owner="true">Qu
 estions? Contact Hannah at community@mhcfoodpantry.org\, or 812-355-6843.</
 a>
