DESCRIPTION:Learn to make your own artisan style sourdough. Sourdough is ma
 de with a few basic ingredients (flour\, water & salt). Sourdough does requ
 ire more time than a bread machine loaf or no-knead but it is very rewardin
 g. Learn how to care for your starter\, fold and shape your dough and how t
 o get a nicely baked loaf in this workshop!\n\n*Masks required\n\nTo regist
 er\, email Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org.
