DESCRIPTION:Join us for a basic information session about what naloxone is\
 , what it does\, and how to use it. Topics that will be covered include inf
 ormation about the opioid epidemic\, Indiana legislation related to Naloxon
 e\, recognizing the signs and symptoms of overdoses\, and much more. Kits w
 ill be handed out to all those who attend the training.\n\nPlease email Liz
  at volunteer@mhcfoodpantry.org if you would like to sign up or have any qu
 estions.
