DESCRIPTION:To be safe\, we won't be offering in-person Nutrition Workshops
  but we do have a virtual opportunity coming up! Our first virtual Nutritio
 n Workshop will be hosted on Zoom and we'll be making Creamy Lemon Pasta an
 d Shallot Dijon Salad. Participants will need to pick up their own ingredie
 nts\, have a zoom enabled device and follow along from home. Once registere
 d\, we'll send you a grocery list\, recipes and general information about t
 he workshop!<br><br>To register click this link: <a href="https://us02web.z
 oom.us/meeting/register/tZwscO6gpjMpG92XtKeb4s0GuEvbcHb3MUJN?fbclid=IwAR0CG
 N7PMcKG8OntSLqObrnGR5FLkQQBHQNxMiWrOTWbt_GlrEGri52IKWU">https://us02web.zoo
 m.us/meeting/register/tZwscO6gpjMpG92XtKeb4s0GuEvbcHb3MUJN</a><br><br>All o
 f our events are free to attend with a suggested $5 donation for those that
  don't meet pantry shopping guidelines. Donations can be made via our websi
 te.<br><br>Questions? Reach out to Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org or
  call 812-355-6843.
