CREATED:20200124T203117Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Hey folks\,</p><p>Following CDC recommendations to help slow
  the spread of COVID-19\, we've made the difficult decision to put all Hub 
 education programming on hold. Our apologies for the late notice - we are r
 esponding as new information is made available. We'll let you know as soon 
 as regular programming resumes.</p><p>We’re eating our way through the midd
 le east this month. Join us to make a variety of dishes packed with fresh v
 eggies\, herbs\, and spices. This workshop will include food from Lebanon\,
  Turkey\, Morocco and Iran. By nature\, all of these recipes will be gluten
  free and vegan!<br></p><p>To register\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa 
 at&nbsp\;<a href="mailto:education@mhcfoodpantry.org">education@mhcfoodpant
 ry.org</a>.</p><br><p>*Workshops are family friendly and free with a sugges
 ted $5 donation for those that don't meet out<a href="https://www.mhcfoodpa
 ntry.org/foodpantry">&nbsp\;patron guidelines</a>.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200311T195020Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Middle Eastern Food Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
