CREATED:20190903T145747Z
DESCRIPTION:\nMaking your own noodles is a great skill to have. If you keep
  flour and water around\, then you will always be able to have pasta! Homem
 ade noodles are so tender and flavorful\, it seems unfair to even try to co
 mpare to dried\, store bought pasta. Since they only take minutes to cook\,
  all the prep goes into the making of the noodles. It certainly takes some 
 time\, but it’s interesting and enjoyable work. \n\n\n*Parents are required
  to remain on site but are welcome to participate in garden open hours\, gr
 ab a cup of coffee or tea and relax in the garden or take care of shopping.
 \nWorkshops are free with a suggested $5 donation for those that don't meet
  our patron guidelines.\n\nTo register\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa 
 at education@mhcfoodpantry.org.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190903T145747Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pasta Workshop for Kids
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
