 ipating seed libraries so that they're still available for the community. Y
 ou don't need to bring seeds to take seeds.</p><p>When donating seeds\, ple
 ase make sure your seeds <strong><b>are not from invasive plants</b></stron
 g> and note the following:</p><ul><li>The type and variety of seed</li><li>
 The year the seeds are from</li><li>Whether the seeds are store-bought or s
 elf-saved</li></ul><p>We ask that you <strong><b>please package your seeds<
 /b></strong> so they are easily distributed to other community members\; we
 'll have tools and supplies on-hand.</p><p>Please contact Maggie Hutt at mh
 utt@mcpl.info if you have any questions about this program.</p>For more Inf
 o <a href="https://calendar.mcpl.info/event/16878536">https://calendar.mcpl
 .info/event/16878536</a>
