 ore. No previous experience necessary\; gloves and tools provided. Please b
 ring your own water bottle and wear weather-appropriate clothing.\n\n*Volun
 teers are expected to be vaccinated. If you are not vaccinated\, you can st
 ill join in our outdoor volunteer opportunities while wearing a mask.
