CREATED:20230717T125501Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an immersive eco printing workshop on tote bags\, w
 here creativity meets sustainability! Discover the art of transforming plai
 n canvas totes into vibrant\, nature-inspired masterpieces. Learn the techn
 iques of eco printing\, a sustainable and eco-friendly method that utilizes
  natural materials and plant dyes to create stunning patterns on fabric. Un
 leash your artistic side as you experiment with various flowers\, discoveri
 ng their unique imprints and colors. Immerse yourself in the therapeutic pr
 ocess of arranging foliage on the fabric\, revealing hidden shapes and colo
 rs as the prints emerge. Email <a href="mailto:garden@mhcfoodpantry.org" ta
 rget="_blank">garden@mhcfoodpantry.org</a> to register.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230717T125501Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ecoprint Workshop (Classroom)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
