CREATED:20220608T144314Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br>Food\, kitchen projects\, and conversation are fueled b
 y a good read in this unique book club! This month we will read&nbsp\;<i>Th
 e Particular Sadness of Lemon Cake</i>&nbsp\;by Aimee Bender at Mother Hubb
 ard's Cupboard (1100 W. Allen Street\, Bloomington) while making a kitchen 
 craft!&nbsp\;Being able to taste people's emotions in food may at first be 
 horrifying. But young\, unassuming Rose Edelstein grows up learning to harn
 ess her gift as she becomes aware that there are secrets even her taste bud
 s cannot discern.<br><br>All supplies are provided\, and books can be check
 ed out from the Library or Mother Hubbard’s Cupboard. For all ages. Project
 s will be made in small groups or as individuals. Please register once per 
 group.<br><br><i>A partnership between Mother Hubbard's Cupboard and the Li
 brary</i>
