DESCRIPTION:Have more seeds than you know what to do with? Want to try out 
 new varieties in this year's garden? Saved seeds at home and interested in 
 sharing them with other community members?\n\nThen join us for MHC's Annual
  Seed Swap! Bring some seeds to share and trade\, take some new ones home\,
  connect with other local gardeners. We'll have drinks and snacks available
  for nibbling on while you look through seeds and dream of the coming garde
 n season.\n\nAll seeds welcome - vegetable\, flowers\, herbs\, organic\, ho
 me-grown\, open-pollinated\, hybrids\, heirlooms\, bulk seeds\, etc. Bringi
 ng seeds not required\, but strongly encouraged!\n\nQuestions? Contact Erik
 a at 812-355-6843 or email at garden@mhcfoodpantry.org. This event is free\
 , family-friendly\, and does not require registration. 
