  top of the list. The cold is perfect for using root vegetables to make hea
 lthy\, hearty\, slow cooked meals. Variations of stew are made all around t
 he world but we’ll be focusing on some American classics. We’ll be making v
 egetarian and meat versions in this workshop.<br><br><br><p style="">To reg
 ister\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org.</
 p><br><p style="">*Workshops are free with a suggested $5 donation for thos
 e that don't meet out<a href="https://www.mhcfoodpantry.org/foodpantry" sty
 le=""> patron guidelines</a>.</p>
