DESCRIPTION:Join us for this pierogi making drop-in event! Pierogi are East
 ern European savory or sweet dumplings that are boiled and then pan-fried u
 ntil crispy (often with shallots\, onions\, or leeks). Come on in to the Hu
 b Kitchen anytime between 1 and 3 pm to make a few\, taste and grab a recip
 e. This will be a hands-on\, family friendly event.\n\nIf you're interested
  and would like a reminder before the event give us a call at 812-355-6843 
 or email education@mhcfoodpantry.org.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190425T204354Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pierogi Drop-In Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
