DESCRIPTION:Gnocchi are pillowy Italian potato dumplings made of flour\, po
 tatoes and egg but vary in flavor and technique depending on the region. Th
 ey are boiled and then served with sauce such as tomato sauce or brown butt
 er sage. \n\nIf you're interested and would like a reminder before the even
 t give us a call at 812-355-6843 or email education@mhcfoodpantry.org.
