DESCRIPTION:Homemade macaroni and cheese is entirely different from the kin
 d that comes out of a box. It can be tailored to your tastes and can be mad
 e simply for a quick\, easy meal or be more complex and decadent. It can be
  baked or made on the stovetop\, be creamy or like a casserole\, vegan or c
 heesy. Join us to try a few and find your favorites!<br><br><br><p>To regis
 ter\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org.</p>
 <p>*Workshops are free with a suggested $5 donation for those that don't me
 et out<a href="https://www.mhcfoodpantry.org/foodpantry"> patron guidelines
 </a>.</p>
