DESCRIPTION:<p>This is a partnership with and at the MCPL Southwest branch.
  Register at <a href="https://calendar.mcpl.info/event/12425903">https://ca
 lendar.mcpl.info/event/12425903</a></p><p>We'll start with store-bought dum
 pling wraps and focus on the delicious fillings! We'll make a variety of di
 fferent fillings\, and everyone will be able to make their own dumplings to
  take home. We'll also discuss different sauces and dips for each variety.<
 /p><p>All attendees must sign a waiver\; <a href="https://mcpl.info/sites/d
 efault/files/images/sw_teaching_kitchen_waiver_mcpl_2023.pdf">you can downl
 oad and sign it</a> prior to the program\, or you can sign one of the copie
 s we'll have on-site. Please contact Becky Craft at bcraft@mcpl.info if you
  have any questions about this program.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250117T171405Z
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library - Southwest Branch\, 890 W Gordon Pik
 e\, Bloomington\, IN 47403\, USA
