DESCRIPTION:<br><p>Hey folks\,</p><p>Following CDC recommendations to help 
 slow the spread of COVID-19\, we've made the difficult decision to put all 
 Hub education programming on hold. Our apologies for the late notice - we a
 re responding as new information is made available. We'll let you know as s
 oon as regular programming resumes.</p>Join us for Kids Cook every Tuesday 
 and Thursday evening! At this weekly drop-in\, kids of all ages and experie
 nce levels can cook up delicious recipes with fresh ingredients.<br><br>For
  questions\, contact Georgia at <a href="mailto:youth@mhcfoodpantry.org">yo
 uth@mhcfoodpantry.org</a>\, or 812-355-6843.
