CREATED:20220718T192546Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Dumplings are an essential food for Chinese New Year
 . Family members get together to chat and have great fun making a lot of du
 mplings with many different fillings. During the 5 days of celebration\, th
 ere is no need to spend lots of time cooking\, the dumplings have already b
 een prepared and only need heating.  Some of the provinces have a tradition
  of eating vegetable dumplings only on the second day of New Year to honor 
 the ancestors. Nowadays it’s a common food for everyone. <br><br>Join us to
  learn the special technique and proper way to cook them.  You can make a l
 ot of them to freeze and enjoy the convenience later.<br><br>To register\, 
 sign up in the pantry\, email Alissa at <a href="mailto:education@mhcfoodpa
 ntry.org">education@mhcfoodpantry.org</a> or call 812-355-6843.<br><br>*Mas
 ks are required</html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T134532Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Chinese Dumplings
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
