DESCRIPTION:Soil is - quite literally! - the foundation of everything we do
  in the Hub gardens. Healthy soil leads to healthy plants\, and there's not
 hing better for soil health than homegrown compost. Using our own compost s
 ystems as an example\, we will cover the basics of composting\, showcase di
 fferent small-scale methods for the backyard composter\, & share tips we’ve
  learned over the years! \n\nTo register for this workshop call 812-355-684
 3 or email Erika at garden@mhcfoodpantry.org.
