  extend your gardening year into the fall and winter. Learn how to plan a c
 old season garden and to mitigate cold temperatures with weather barriers t
 hat allow for fresh vegetables when most gardens have been put to bed for t
 he season.&nbsp\; We’ll also go over the basics of getting your garden tuck
 ed in for the winter\, and how to prepare ahead in the fall for healthier s
 oil in the coming spring. To register\, email Audrey at <a href="mailto:gar
 den@mhcfoodpantry.org"><u>garden@mhcfoodpantry.org</u></a>\,
