DESCRIPTION:Closing the Hunger Gap is a national network of food banks\, pa
 ntries\, and other anti-hunger organizations and advocates. We believe that
  a better world and approach to ending hunger are possible\, and we are bui
 lding a movement to make it happen. Join us this February for the first in 
 a yearlong series of national gatherings to learn\, share\, and build towar
 d this shared vision.  It will feature a conversation with two food bank CE
 Os who are shifting their organizations toward justice\, taking concrete st
 eps toward ending hunger— for good—and changing the food banking business m
 odel as we know it today.  <br><br>Register: <a href="https://us02web.zoom.
 us/MEETING/REGISTER/WKMPDQ6QRUIQIQIKLZQFMA#/registration">https://us02web.z
 oom.us/MEETING/REGISTER/WKMPDQ6QRUIQIQIKLZQFMA#/registration</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250127T152711Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Strategies for Food Justice panel
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
