DESCRIPTION:<a href="goog_176556369">Join us for the monthly Hub Dinner! Si
 t down over a hearty meal\, connect with other community members\, and talk
  shop about everything from food systems to healthcare\, housing to transpo
 rtation!&nbsp\;</a><br><a href="goog_176556369"><br></a><br><a href="goog_1
 76556369">At this month's Dinner\, we'll be working through what issues &am
 p\; policies folks want to follow during the 2020 Indiana Legislative sessi
 on\, and talking about how they connect to each other. This Dinner will be 
 the kick-off of our Fall series on how the Indiana Legislature works. Month
 -by-month we'll learn everything from when &amp\; how the state's legislati
 ve session happens\, to how a bill gets passed at the State level\, from ho
 w to connect with legislators\, to how to tell a compelling personal story.
 &nbsp\;</a><br><a href="goog_176556369"><br></a><br><a href="goog_176556369
 ">No advocacy experience necessary to join\, new faces always welcome! Dinn
 er will be vegetarian-friendly!&nbsp\;</a><br><a href="goog_176556369"><br>
 </a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/906060989751975/" id="ow46
 1" __is_owner="true">Questions? Contact Hannah at community@mhcfoodpantry.o
 rg\, or 812-355-6843.</a>
