UID:57750AC1-FDCF-4B86-B6F6-A56A35EDE84A
CREATED:20181212T164700Z
DESCRIPTION:2019 is on its way\, and it's bringing the Indiana General Asse
 mbly with it!\n\nTo get a jump start on the new year's session\, we'll be s
 pending December's Hub Dinner brushing up on some IGA education and advocac
 y tools for action! \n\nWe'll also spend some time breaking out into small 
 groups\, based on three bills we expect to be introduced in 2019! These bil
 ls will cover pregnancy accommodations for workers\, updating the eligibili
 ty guidelines for TANF (Temporary Assistance for Needy Families)\, and rest
 ricting predatory payday lending.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you there! G
 ot questions? Contact Hannah at community@mhcfoodpantry.org\, or 812-355-68
 43.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181212T164858Z
LOCATION:1100 W. Allen St. 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hub Dinner 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
