DESCRIPTION:<br><p>Hey folks\,</p><p>Following CDC recommendations to help 
 slow the spread of COVID-19\, we've made the difficult decision to put all 
 Hub education programming on hold. Our apologies for the late notice - we a
 re responding as new information is made available. We'll let you know as s
 oon as regular programming resumes.</p><br>Can’t wait to get your hands dir
 ty this season? Neither can we! That’s one of the many reasons we start muc
 h of our garden from seed.  Starting from seed lets you get a head start on
  the season\, greatly increases your options for variety\, is economical\, 
 and just downright enjoyable! Come learn the basics of seed starting while 
 helping us start seeds for our community garden. To register\, contact Erik
 a at <a href="mailto:garden@mhcfoodpantry.org">garden@mhcfoodpantry.org</a>
  or call 812.355.6843.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200311T195008Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Seed Starting Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
