CREATED:20230522T183050Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>This year marks the Hub’s 25th year serving our community. C
 ome celebrate with us! We’re putting together a fundraiser that should be a
  day of fun for all ages. Join for the first Hub Block Party hosted on June
  10 from 11 am to 2 pm at our location\, 1100 W. Allen Street. </p><p>Come 
 enjoy a bounce house. Dunk the Hub crew in a dunk tank. Join fellow communi
 ty members in lawn games\, water balloon tosses\, and basketball shootouts.
  Enjoy a lunch brought to you by <a href="https://thesmokeworks.com/">Smoke
 works</a>. Grab an ice cream courtesy of <a href="https://moosebtown.com/">
 Chocolate Moose</a>.</p><p><a href="https://checkout.square.site/buy/5RNHCS
 L4D5QEBXBBVO5R3P2D">Tickets are on sale now! Tickets are $25 for adults\, $
 10 for children 10 and under (children under 2 are free). Ticket prices inc
 lude food\, ice cream\, and all games except tie-dye and corn hole. </a>Vis
 it our website at mhcfoodpantry.org/blockparty to get your tickets today!</
 p><p>Add even more fun to your day by joining in a corn hole tournament. Th
 e bracketed tournament will begin at noon with just $10 entry per team.</p>
 <p>The Hub will also have limited edition white bandanas for sale\, which p
 articipants will have the option to tie dye. We look forward to seeing thes
 e one-of-a-kind pieces throughout our community after the event!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230522T183050Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Block Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
