DESCRIPTION:Join Mother Hubbard's Cupboard's Garden Program to learn how to
  extend your gardening year into the fall and winter. Learn how to plan a c
 old season garden and to mitigate cold temperatures with weather barriers t
 hat allow for fresh vegetables when most gardens have been put to bed for t
 he season.  We’ll also go over the basics of getting your garden tucked in 
 for the winter\, and how to prepare ahead in the fall for healthier soil in
  the coming spring. \n\nClasses free and open to all with a suggested $5 do
 nation for those that don't meet our pantry guidelines. \n\nTo sign up for 
 this class\, please email: garden@mhcfoodpantry.org or call 812-355-6843.
