UID:1r63n8qbvf3vc4a8r9ein5d0c8@google.com
CREATED:20250502T195702Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/closing-
 the-hunger-gap?trk=public_post-text" target="_blank"><b>Closing the Hunger 
 Gap</b></a> is hosting our third event in our new yearlong series with a re
 flective discussion on the Theory of Change! Join us for a generative dialo
 gue with leadership team members in the <b>BE group</b>. Closing the Hunger
  Gap is a national network of food banks\, pantries\, and other anti-hunger
  organizations and advocates. We believe that for all communities to have a
 ccess to the food they need and want\, we need a liberated\, joyful way of 
 BEING in a beloved community in which all people are free from oppression\,
  fully resourced\, and able to truly thrive.</p><p dir="ltr"> </p><p dir="l
 tr">✅ Readings from The Serviceberry: Abundance and Reciprocity in the Natu
