DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><p>Let's swap seeds and help the gardens of Monroe 
 County grow! All ages.</p><br><br><br><p></p><p>The Downtown Library and Mo
 ther Hubbard’s Cupboard will also have free seeds available. Any leftover s
 eeds will be donated to the participating seed libraries so that they're st
 ill available for the community. You don't need to bring seeds to take seed
 s.</p><p>When donating seeds\, please make sure your seeds<strong><b> are n
 ot from invasive plants</b></strong> and note the following:</p><ul><li>The
  type and variety of seed</li><li>The year the seeds are from</li><li>Wheth
 er the seeds are store-bought or self-saved</li></ul><p>We ask that you<str
 ong><b> please package your seeds</b></strong> so they are easily distribut
 ed to other community members\; we will have tools and supplies on-hand.</p
 ><p><br></p><p><a href="https://calendar.mcpl.info/event/15658248">https://
 calendar.mcpl.info/event/15658248</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260223T193107Z
