 iety of techniques and making an assortment of cookies. They’re fun to make
  and are great for sharing! This is a family friendly workshop with all age
 s welcome!!<br><br>To register\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa at <a hr
 ef="mailto:education@mhcfoodpantry.org">education@mhcfoodpantry.org</a><br>
