CREATED:20200124T210426Z
DESCRIPTION:Making your own noodles is a great skill to have. If you keep f
 lour and water around\, then you will always be able to have pasta! Homemad
 e noodles are so tender and flavorful\, it seems unfair to even try to comp
 are to dried\, store bought pasta. Since they only take minutes to cook\, a
 ll the prep goes into the making of the noodles. It certainly takes some ti
 me\, but it’s interesting and enjoyable work.<br><br><br><p style="">To reg
 ister\, call 812-355-6843 or email Alissa at education@mhcfoodpantry.org.</
 p><br>*Workshops are family-friendly and free with a suggested $5 donation 
 for those that don't meet our<a href="https://www.mhcfoodpantry.org/foodpan
 try" style=""> patron guidelines</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200124T210426Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pasta Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
